  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of Priority Area 2 (PFM) - MIP 2021-2027 Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this assignment is to provide support to the European Union Delegation to Mongolia in identifying and formulating actions under &lt;u&gt;Priority Area 2: Democratic and Economic Development/ Specific Objective 3: Strengthening domestic revenue mobilization, public finance management, fighting against corruption&lt;/u&gt; as outlined in the EU MIP for Mongolia (2021-2027), in consultation with the Government and relevant stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
